tions\n                   Schema                   |    Name    | Type  |  Owner   |  Size   | Description \n--------------------------------------------+------------+-------+----------+---------+-------------\n pg_temp_161b6b79a0ce47a6909f8e517dc79657_1 | t3         | table | yugabyte | 0 bytes | \n pg_temp_161b6b79a0ce47a6909f8e517dc79657_1 | temp_table | table | yugabyte | 0 bytes | \n(2 rows)\n\nyugabyte=# \\d+ t3\n                  Table \"pg_temp_161b6b79a0ce47a6909f8e517dc79657_1.t3\"\n Column |  Type   | Collation | Nullable | Default | Storage | Stats target | Description \n--------+---------+-----------+----------+---------+---------+--------------+-------------\n id     | integer |           |          |         | plain   |              | \n\nyugabyte=# insert into t3 (id) values (100);\nERROR:  could not open file \"base/13263/t1_16407\": No such file or directory\n```\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-16848]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-16848?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"sushantrmishra","id":7229015,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjkwMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7229015?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra","html_url":"https://github.com/sushantrmishra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api